What of it is here:

- hevc_d_h265.c (GPL-2.0-or-later): the command generator,
  src/cmdgen/hevc_d_h265.c, with the V4L2 framework's functions replaced
  and every other change marked "rpivid:". src/cmdgen/UPSTREAM names the
  original (commit and blob).
- hevc_d_hw.h (GPL-2.0): the register map, src/cmdgen/hevc_d_hw.h.
- hevc_d.h and hevc_d_video.h/.c (GPL-2.0): the structure names and limits
  the kept functions see, and the buffer size formulas, in
  src/cmdgen/hevc_d.h, src/cmdgen/hevc_d_video.h and src/cmdgen/cmdgen.c;
  cmdgen.c also keeps a few blocks of hevc_d_h265.c, each marked.


