3. The driver stack's parts it builds on
-------------------------------

Each ships its licence beside this one in the archive.

- emu68-common (MPL-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later): helpers, DMA memory, cache
  operations, the driver task and the reset guard, linked into every
  binary.
- emu68-gic400-library (MPL-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later): gic400.library's
  interface, through which the interrupt is served.
- videocodec-library (BSD-3-Clause): the backend interface of
  videocodec.library that rpivid.codec implements.


4. Used to build and test, in no binary
---------------------------------------

- FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later): the reference decoder on the host; the
  conformance references in tests/conformance/ are FFmpeg 5.1's.
- The HEVC conformance bitstreams (JCT-VC's HEVC_v1 set, from the ITU's
  site), fetched by tests/host/fetch-conformance.sh; never part of the
  repository, only the checksums of their decoded pictures are.
